        "created_at": "2013-04-18T00:12:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Since PMs don't send a instant pop-up saying you've got one, that may not really do much of anything.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Also we could have the Googlge doc sheet editable for everyone, so that way more than one person can go on there and change the things they did on their turn aswell. Copying and pasting the end result of the peoples post on there may be helpful, so that way everyone can visibly see what everyone has in hand as well rather than trying to dig up their last post.</p>",
