        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/9fc29f/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-18T01:36:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Great game!</p><p>It was nice to be able to play on the forum since I'm away from my gaming group for 2 weeks and hasn't played a single game since (other than this forum game).</p><p>One point I would add is about knowing the cards. For me, I don't remember all the cards very well, so when I'm away from my cards, I won't know exactly what happened. For instance, I can't remember how much damage Hasten Doom deals.</p><p>Any suggestions for people who don't remember the cards or don't have the cards with them at the moment?</p>",
