      {
        "id": 58046,
        "name": "MigrantP",
        "username": "MigrantP",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-18T04:07:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The google doc was editable by anyone who sent me a PM with their email address, as I requested. I only got PMs from two people.</p><p>I don't know the cards by name at all really. But it's not like the game has to move quickly, so it's no problem to wait until you have the cards at hand.</p><p>I think the PM works well as a \"next turn nudge\" since it sends an email.</p>",
