      {
        "id": 58047,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-18T04:14:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I have mine disabled so it doesn't send e-mails, nor do I even check my e-mail too often. In fact I check the forums more often than my e-mail. So it may be just me, but i'm more likely to see the topic updated rather than an pm.</p><p>Guess I overlooked the sending PM part of it, though it is possible to make it globally editable for all, and the creator can undo things back to a previous state so if anyone goes on and screws around with it there wouldn't be much of an issue with that. As collecting e-mails from different people would become a little troublesome.</p>",
