        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-04-18T04:29:25.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>The topic is updated when you take your turn, since you're posting in it. Sending the PM is a courtesy, and certainly useful for most people I think.</p><p>Getting email addresses from 4 or 5 other people is not really a problem, if they bother to send them =). Having a globally editable doc could be a lot more hassle - is everyone going to check the revision history before making an edit to see if it was messed with? But it could be worth a try.</p>",
